    {
      "id": "tenant-flow",
      "page": "tenant",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 700,
      "text": "The whole tenant job, left to right: open the link, photograph the meter, check the number, done.\nSubmission is still one-way \u2014 the confirm sheet is where that gets said plainly."
    },
    {
      "id": "admin-note",
      "page": "admin",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 700,
      "text": "Dark by default, like the console today. Desktop is the working surface; the phone artboard on the right is the same screen for approving a bill on the move."
    },
    {
      "id": "data-note",
      "page": "foundations",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 620,
      "text": "Properties, tenant names, slugs and the \u20b99/unit rate come from lib/config.js. Readings, amounts and contact names are sample data."
    },
    {
      "id": "open-pair",
      "page": "admin",
      "x": 1420,
      "y": 960,
      "w": 1000,
      "text": "Card open state \u2014 same tenant, web and mobile. Click a card to open it in place: check the photo, fix the reading, approve. Web spreads photo and entry side by side; mobile stacks them."
    },
    {
      "id": "tenant-dark",
      "page": "tenant",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 960,
      "w": 700,
      "text": "Dark tenant app \u2014 same screens, dark palette. Note: the live app is light-only today; this shows how a dark theme would look if added."
    }
  ],
